<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Walibi H1 1996 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Belgian Walibi H1 1996 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons turnover/sales	   888.1	vs  840.8</p>
<p>    Group net profit/loss	 418.5 loss vs  395.6 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian Walibi NV is a holiday parks operator with units in Belgium, France and the Netherlands.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
